# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AMP Field — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local`, `.env.development`, `.env.staging` or `.env.production`
# and fill in the values for that backend. These files are git-ignored.
#
# Select the environment when running commands:
#   APP_ENV=development npm start
#
# SECURITY
#   * Only the Supabase anon / publishable key may appear here. The app refuses
#     to start if a service-role or secret key is supplied.
#   * Never point a development build at the production Supabase project.
#   * Production values belong in EAS secrets / CI secrets, not in a file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
